{"chunk_id": "f5814d33c4b2", "text": "At the end of his earthly mission, Rama journeys to the sacred Sarayu River accompanied by crowds of loyal subjects. As he prepares to depart the mortal world, Brahma appears in the sky surrounded by gods, sages, and celestial beings riding in radiant aerial chariots. The heavens fill with music, fragrant winds, and showers of flowers as Gandharvas and Apsaras sing. Rama steps into the river, where Brahma hails him openly as Vishnu and invites him to return to his divine form and eternal abode. Accepting this revelation of his true nature, Rama resolves to depart the world and enters Vishnu\u2019s realm with his brothers. The assembled immortals worship him as he resumes his cosmic identity, marking the epic\u2019s final transformation of the heroic king back into the sustaining god of the universe.\nRama walks to the Sarayu, enters the river, and is welcomed by Brahma and the gods as he returns to his true form as Vishnu.\nThemes: divine revelation, apotheosis, return to Vishnu, cosmic recognition, end of Rama's earthly life", "vector": [0.02037721313536167, -0.03415262699127197, -0.013281576335430145, 0.007329558953642845, -0.015022996813058853, 0.0031741929706186056, -0.02827858179807663, -0.015152953565120697, -0.03532223775982857, -0.007920862175524235, 0.014958018437027931, 0.011065814644098282, 0.0038727102801203728, 0.008089805953204632, 0.003953933250159025, -0.007667446509003639, 0.032853059470653534, -0.036413874477148056, 0.029266253113746643, -0.010649953037500381, 0.005731091368943453, -0.018856719136238098, -0.005139788147062063, 0.01371043361723423, -0.017934028059244156, 0.014399204403162003, 0.030955690890550613, -0.030981682240962982, 0.014685109257698059, -0.017193274572491646, -0.0008707100059837103, -0.0021069233771413565, -0.012560317292809486, -0.0003472281096037477, -0.001756040146574378, 0.008070312440395355, -0.008889039978384972, -0.00832372810691595, 0.006874710321426392, -0.01637454703450203, -0.006